{"id":9670129942769,"title":"Kaza Beauty Clear code serum","handle":"kaza-beauty-lip-gloss-1","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"313\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"32\"\u003eKaza Beauty Clear Code Serum\u003c\/strong\u003e is a lightweight, fast-absorbing niacinamide serum designed to help refine the look of pores, control excess oil and improve uneven-looking skin. Powered by \u003cstrong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"209\"\u003e10% niacinamide\u003c\/strong\u003e, it supports a smoother, clearer and more balanced complexion without leaving the skin sticky or heavy.\u003cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"516\"\u003eWith regular use, the serum helps reduce dullness, improve skin texture and maintain a fresh, shine-controlled finish. Its gentle everyday formula layers easily under moisturiser, sunscreen and makeup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"677\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"535\"\u003eKey benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"538\"\u003eMinimises the appearance of pores • Controls excess oil • Brightens dull-looking skin • Smooths uneven texture • Lightweight and non-greasy\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"812\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"694\"\u003eHow to use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Apply 2–3 drops to clean, dry skin before moisturiser. Use once or twice daily, followed by sunscreen during the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-15T02:58:45+05:30","created_at":"2026-07-15T02:58:44+05:30","vendor":"My Store 4","type":"","tags":[],"price":129900,"price_min":129900,"price_max":129900,"available":false,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":null,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false